Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.58,0:00:42.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在1930年的这十年中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the decade of the 1930s{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.20,0:00:45.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使是像梅乔克力斯这般的大城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even the great city of Metropolis{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.50,0:00:49.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也无法抵挡全世界衰退的冲击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was not spared the ravages of the worldwide depression{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.25,0:00:51.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那时代充满了恐惧与迷惑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the times of fear and confusion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.52,0:00:55.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通知大众的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the job of informing the public was the responsibility{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.56,0:00:56.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就落在星球日报的身上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the Daily Planet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.96,0:00:59.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一份大都会的报纸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A great metropolitan newspaper{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.33,0:01:04.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因其慈善及真实性所生之信誉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whose reputation for clarity and truth had become a symbol of hope{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.57,0:01:06.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,促使其成为大都会希望象征之所寄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the city of Metropolis{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.07,0:06:43.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是幻想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is no fantasy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.41,0:06:47.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一望无际的想像不需要留意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No careless product of wild imagination{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.18,0:06:50.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不需要 我的好友们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No my good friends{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.15,0:06:53.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,控诉必备的要件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}these indictments{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.62,0:06:57.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今日我向你们所提的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l've brought you today{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.59,0:07:02.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,系指你们个人所犯之叛国罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}specific charges listed herein against the individuals{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.56,0:07:07.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以及妨害治安之罪行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}their acts of treason Their ultimate aim of sedition{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.67,0:07:11.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.10,0:07:16.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,均是无可否认之事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are matters of undeniable fact{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.48,0:07:23.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要求你们念出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ask you now to pronounce judgment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.45,0:07:26.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,判决的内容\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on those accused{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.39,0:07:35.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对这些被告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.56,0:07:37.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对这个无情的叛离者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this mindless aberration{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.03,0:07:42.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他只想以暴力和破坏来表现其情感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whose only means of expression are wanton violence and destruction{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.57,0:07:46.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对这个女人亚莎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the woman Ursa{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.34,0:07:50.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她对所有全体人类的曲解及不合理的仇恨心态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whose perversions and unreasoning hatred of all mankind{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.11,0:07:54.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经威胁到全体克普顿星球的儿童\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have threatened even the children of the Planet Krypton{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.19,0:08:05.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后一位是查德将军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finally General Zod{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.79,0:08:08.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,曾经是委员会信任的一员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once trusted by this Council{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.99,0:08:12.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仍然背叛维持克普顿星球的辩护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}charged with maintaining the defense of the Planet Krypton itself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.00,0:08:17.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,创造者希望对这种预谋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chief Architect of this intended revolution and author of this insidious plot{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.10,0:08:20.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重新建立一项秩序所作之革命加以摧毁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to establish a new order amongst us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.97,0:08:25.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好让自己仍然成为绝对之统治者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with himself as absolute ruler{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.44,0:08:29.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经听过证据了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have heard the evidence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.65,0:08:33.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在宣布判决的结果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The decision of the Council will now be heard{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.15,0:08:33.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guilty{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.52,0:08:37.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guilty{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.75,0:08:39.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guilty{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.23,0:08:45.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本项表决具有敌意 乔艾尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The vote must be unanimous JorEI{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.16,0:08:48.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在已经变成你的判决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has therefore now become your decision{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.96,0:08:50.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你希望的话 你就判我们有罪吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You alone will condemn us if you wish{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.30,0:08:53.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你就要对我这件事负责了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you alone will be held responsible by me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.95,0:09:03.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加入我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Join us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.02,0:09:09.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家过去都知道你不同意委员会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have been known to disagree with the Council before{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.89,0:09:12.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的声音就新秩序而言是最重要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yours could become an important voice in the new order{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.70,0:09:13.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我的却是次要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}second only to my own{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.12,0:09:18.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给你一个机会 乔艾尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I offer you a chance for greatness JorEI{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.39,0:09:20.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接受吧加入我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it Join us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.40,0:09:24.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会在我面前屈服的 乔艾尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will bow down before me JorEI{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.10,0:09:28.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我发誓 不管天长地久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear it No matter that it takes an eternity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.74,0:09:31.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你终会在我面前屈服的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will bow down before me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.74,0:09:34.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们两个 将来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Both you and then one day{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.21,0:09:35.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有你的子孙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your heirs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.58,0:10:55.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.62,0:10:59.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放我们出去 救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let us out of here Help me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.43,0:11:10.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原谅我 我会回来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forgive me forgive me l shall return{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.12,0:11:31.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个令人不快的职务 已被巧妙地完成了 乔艾尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An unpleasant duty has been masterly performed JorEI{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.69,0:11:34.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们得到了他们应得的命运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have received the fate they deserved{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.13,0:11:37.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隔绝在幽灵区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isolation in the Phantom Zone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.70,0:11:39.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个永恒的活死人区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}an eternal living death{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.27,0:11:44.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但还是个活着的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A chance for life nonetheless{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.04,0:11:46.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我们相反\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As opposed to us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.81,0:11:49.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目前此种状况是自杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's suicide{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.75,0:11:52.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 更糟 是灭种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No it's worse it's genocide{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.58,0:11:54.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我警告你 乔艾尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be warned JorEI{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.95,0:11:58.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,委员会已经对你奇怪的理论作过评估\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Council has already evaluated this outlandish theory of yours{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.46,0:12:03.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的朋友 你知道我既不是草率也不是冲动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My friends you know me to be neither rash nor impulsive{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.89,0:12:08.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不是给你们粗野或不支持的声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not given to wild unsupported statements{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.07,0:12:13.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我告诉你们 我们必须马上撤离这个星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I tell you that we must evacuate this planet immediately{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.57,0:12:17.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔艾尔 你是克普顿星球 最伟大的科学家之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}JorEI you are one of Krypton's greatest scientists{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.77,0:12:19.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 不过凡德阿也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes but so is VondAh{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.88,0:12:26.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是他们问你问题的答案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't question your data{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.05,0:12:28.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实不容否认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The facts are undeniable{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.55,0:12:34.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是你的结论 但我认为不能苟同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's your conclusions we find unsupportable{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.43,0:12:40.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个星球只剩下最多三十天就会爆炸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This planet will explode within 30 days{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.30,0:12:42.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果没意外的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If not sooner{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.13,0:12:45.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我告诉你克普顿星球依然会绕着轨道运转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tell you Krypton is simply shifting its orbit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.44,0:12:47.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔艾尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}JorEI{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.30,0:12:49.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讲理一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}be reasonable{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.61,0:12:52.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My friend{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.11,0:12:58.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从不曾如此 不讲理的人是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have never been otherwise This madness is yours{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.01,0:13:00.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讨论到此为止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This discussion is terminated{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.42,0:13:04.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,委员会的心意已决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The decision of the Council is final{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.61,0:13:26.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你如果想做任何对本星球不利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any attempt by you to create{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.21,0:13:30.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或散布令人忧惧之事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a climate of fear and panic among the populace{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.61,0:13:34.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们均将视为叛乱的行为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}must be deemed by us an act of insurrection{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.08,0:13:37.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想用叛乱罪逮捕我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You would accuse me of insurrection{\r}
