Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.19,0:28:09.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 克拉克 我们明天的衣服都要洗好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark let's have those clothes washed and ready for tomorrow's game{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.59,0:28:11.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要打倒芒特佛南高中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got to beat Mount Vernon High{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.32,0:28:14.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早点回家 可不可以帮个忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Home early Can you give me a lift{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.90,0:28:20.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拉娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lana{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.97,0:28:24.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要烦恼这些 我会一起收拾的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't bother with these I'll take them in with the other equipment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.11,0:28:28.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 克拉克  - 没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you Clark  - Sure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.41,0:28:32.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 我们一票人要去玛莉艾伦家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen a whole bunch of us are going up to Mary Ellen's{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.58,0:28:35.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听听音乐 你要来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Play some records Would you like to come{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.99,0:28:38.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.95,0:28:40.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像很好玩的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds like it could be a lot of fun{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.32,0:28:43.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯特不能去 因为还有很多事要做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kent can't make it Still got a lot of work to do{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.36,0:28:46.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在说什么 我刚刚堆完\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about I've just finished stacking{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.10,0:28:48.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有那些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.26,0:28:50.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 布雷特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh Brad{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.57,0:28:53.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 来呀 拉娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey come on Lana{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.30,0:28:56.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.77,0:28:59.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 走啦 他得整理这些呢 - 再见 克拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He has to clean up - Bye Clark{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.44,0:29:01.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 再见 拉娜  - 赶快整理吧 克拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bye Lana  - Clean this up Clark{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.43,0:29:04.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走啦 拜 克拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go 'Bye Clark{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.61,0:29:07.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要去玛莉艾伦家了 明天见 克拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're off to Mary Ellen's See you Clark{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.95,0:29:09.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.95,0:29:12.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜 克拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye Clark{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.29,0:29:15.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天见 再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you tomorrow Byebye{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.63,0:30:28.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 我看到那边一个男孩 跑得跟火车一样快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mommy I saw a boy out there run as fast as the train{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.16,0:30:30.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至更快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faster even{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.37,0:30:34.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露意丝雷恩 你想像力真丰富\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lois Lane you have a writer's gift for invention{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.00,0:30:36.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会帮你说好话的 可是 可是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll say that for you But{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.31,0:30:39.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露意丝 看你的书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lois please read your book{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.54,0:30:42.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都没人相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one ever believes me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.76,0:31:15.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们看 是克拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey look there's Clark{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.95,0:31:18.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他怎么会在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How come he's here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.88,0:31:19.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.95,0:31:22.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么会来的这么快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you get here so fast{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.68,0:31:24.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我用跑的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ran{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.89,0:31:26.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ran huh{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.32,0:31:29.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉你 他是个奇怪的人 我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Told you he was an oddball Let's get out of here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.40,0:31:38.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又在炫耀了 是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Been showing off a bit haven't you Son?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.51,0:31:53.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是故意要炫耀的 爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't mean to show off Pa{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.05,0:32:00.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是大家都喜欢布雷特 我只是想玩弄他们而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just that guys like that Brad I just want to tear them apart{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.79,0:32:01.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah I know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.82,0:32:04.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道不应该\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah I know I shouldn't{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.39,0:32:07.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你可以做很多令人惊讶的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah I know you can do all these amazing things{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.30,0:32:10.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时候你是不想顾虑太多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and sometimes you think that you will just go bust{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.16,0:32:12.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是除非你可以对大家明讲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}unless you can tell people about it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.20,0:32:13.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 那就对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah That's right{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.57,0:32:16.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我去玩足球 每次都可以达阵得分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean every time I get the football I can make a touchdown{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.64,0:32:18.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 每次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's for sure Every time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.77,0:32:22.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说如果有一个人做他可以做得到的事也是炫耀吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it showing off when somebody's doing the things he's capable of doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.44,0:32:24.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸟能飞也是炫耀吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is a bird showing off when it flies?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.55,0:32:27.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不 你听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No no Now you listen to me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.92,0:32:31.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当你第一次来到这里 我们以为别人会来把你带走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you came to us we thought people would take you away{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.39,0:32:34.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为当我们发现你的能力之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when they found out the things that you do{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.99,0:32:36.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那的确让我们很担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It worried us a lot{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.99,0:32:40.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当一个人老了之后 想法不同了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then when a man gets older and he thinks very differently{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.80,0:32:42.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有些事对他而言就比较清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And things get very clear{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.00,0:32:47.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只知道一件事 儿子 你会在这里就是有其原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there's one thing I do know Son and that is you are here for a reason{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.47,0:32:51.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知是谁的原因 或是什么原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know whose reason or whatever the reason is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.16,0:32:52.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许是因为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}maybe it's because{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.88,0:32:58.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.35,0:33:03.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我知道 绝不只是为达阵得分而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I do know one thing It's not to score touchdowns{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.46,0:33:08.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks Dad{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.16,0:33:11.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸 我们赛跑回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll race you to it Yeah{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.19,0:33:13.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.49,0:33:15.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来 加油来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on,Papa run,come on,move{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.70,0:33:18.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油 布朗 好耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go go Come on Hey Baron{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.68,0:33:29.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh no{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.83,0:33:47.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,强纳森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jonathan{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.96,0:33:51.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,强纳森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jonathan{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.77,0:33:58.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.95,0:34:02.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.69,0:34:07.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,强纳森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jonathan{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.69,0:34:11.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.89,0:34:51.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All those things I can do{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.83,0:34:55.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我可以做所有的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all those powers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.17,0:35:00.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我却无法救他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I couldn't even save him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.15,0:38:02.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克拉克 起床啰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark get up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.59,0:38:08.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早安啊 斯麦利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning Smiley{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.72,0:38:11.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克拉克 吃早餐啰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark breakfast{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.66,0:38:17.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你打算睡一整天吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you going to sleep all day{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.70,0:38:21.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克拉克 别这样 起床\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark come on Get up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.03,0:39:24.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to leave{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.64,0:39:32.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我早知道此刻会到来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew this time would come{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.94,0:39:36.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从发现你那天起我就知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We both knew it from the day we found you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.59,0:39:50.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我昨天和班哈巴谈过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I talked to Ben Hubbard yesterday{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.63,0:39:56.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说 他从现在起愿意来帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said that he'd be happy to help out from now on{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.84,0:40:06.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,母亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.58,0:40:09.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我了解 儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know Son{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.28,0:40:13.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.65,0:40:20.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道你要往那儿去吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know where you're headed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.06,0:40:26.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,北方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}North{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.00,0:40:33.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要记得我们 儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember us Son{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.67,0:40:37.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永远记得我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always remember us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.07,0:46:15.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My son{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.52,0:46:24.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不记得我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you do not remember me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.85,0:46:26.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是乔艾尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am JorEI{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.76,0:46:30.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是你父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am your father{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.56,0:46:35.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在你快18岁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By now you will have reached your eighteenth year{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.93,0:46:37.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果以地球的日子算的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as it is measured on Earth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.77,0:46:40.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果这样计算的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By that reckoning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.37,0:46:44.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我早已死去几千年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will have been dead for many thousands of your years{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.97,0:46:48.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我所知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The knowledge{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.44,0:46:52.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有关身体及历史的知识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I have of matters physical and historical{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.11,0:46:56.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已在你去新家的路上都给了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have given you fully on your voyage to your new home{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.55,0:46:59.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些都十分重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are important matters to be sure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.59,0:47:02.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但仍只是事实而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but still matters of mere fact{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.52,0:47:06.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有很多问题要问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are questions to be asked{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.49,0:47:10.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你该去探寻的时候了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it is time for you to do so{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.10,0:47:14.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here in this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.77,0:47:18.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孤立的城堡中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this fortress of solitude{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.04,0:47:22.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一起去找寻答案吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we shall try to find the answers together{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.38,0:47:25.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So my son{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.98,0:47:27.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说话吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}speak{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.82,0:47:30.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who am I{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.02,0:47:33.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的名字是凯尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your name is KalEI{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.99,0:47:38.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是克普顿星球唯一的生还者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are the only survivor of the Planet Krypton{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.06,0:47:43.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使你是由人类扶养长大 你也不属于他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even though you were raised as a human you are not one of them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.33,0:47:48.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有强大的力量 有一些是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have great powers only some of which you have{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.70,0:47:50.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尚未发掘的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as yet discovered{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.07,0:47:54.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我来吧 我的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come with me now my son{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.74,0:47:57.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当我们突破地球的限制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as we break through the bars of your earthly confinement{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.74,0:47:59.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在时间与空间中旅游 在六度空间中遨游\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Traveling through time and space{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.48,0:48:05.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的力量可以超越那些凡人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your powers will far exceed those of mortal men{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.29,0:48:08.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你不能干涉人类的历史\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is forbidden for you to interfere with human history{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.19,0:48:11.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不能用你的领导力去影响他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rather let your leadership stir others to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.29,0:48:17.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过几年后 我们会来试验人们的心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the next year we shall examine the human heart{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.37,0:48:20.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们比你的还更脆弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is more fragile than your own{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.87,0:48:22.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过去两年里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the past two years{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.67,0:48:24.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当我们飞越炎热的混乱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As we pass through the flaming{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.48,0:48:26.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是你自己的银河系边缘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}turmoil which is the edge of your own galaxy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.34,0:48:29.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们即将进入红色克普顿星球的领域\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we will enter the realm of the red Krypton sun{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.91,0:48:32.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的力量及营养来源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}source of your strength and nourishment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.45,0:48:34.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最终引起了克普顿星球的毁灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and cause of our eventual destruction{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.32,0:48:38.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的孩子 这个克普顿星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Planet Krypton my son{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.69,0:48:41.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是你的家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your home as it was{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.99,0:48:47.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一年我们会试验不同的道德观念\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This year we shall examine the various concepts of immortality{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.26,0:48:50.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以及他们的事实基础\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and their basis in actual fact{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.40,0:48:55.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有知识的累积 都将延伸到28条银河系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The total accumulation of all knowledge spanning the 28 known galaxies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.04,0:48:59.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并藏于水晶之中 我均已传送给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is embedded in the crystals which I have sent along with you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.61,0:49:01.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好的研读它们 我的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Study them well my son{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.45,0:49:02.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在过去12年的学习中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and learn from them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.80,0:49:04.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们早已超越逻辑的判断之外了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've reasoned out logical judgments{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.81,0:49:07.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在你回到你的银河系之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the time you return to the confines of your galaxy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.38,0:49:10.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必定已过去十二年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}twelve of your years will have passed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.22,0:49:12.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为这个理由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For this reason among others{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.12,0:49:16.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我为你选择了地球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have chosen Earth for you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.36,0:49:19.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,此刻 是你重新投入新世界的时刻了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is now time for you to rejoin your new world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.03,0:49:22.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去服务全体人类吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and to serve its collective humanity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.83,0:49:25.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当他们其中的一分子 凯尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Live as one of them KalEI{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.67,0:49:29.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去发现你尚未发掘的力量及能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and discover where your strength and your power are needed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.14,0:49:34.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些特殊的遗传 是你可以自豪的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But always hold in your heart the pride of your special heritage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.11,0:49:38.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们可能会成为伟大的人 凯尔 他们很希望如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They can be a great people KalEI they wish to be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.88,0:49:42.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们只是缺乏光明 以照亮他们的路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They only lack the light to show the way{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.15,0:49:47.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为此一理由 他们可以培养成为优良的人格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For this reason above all their capacity for good{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.79,0:49:50.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把他们交给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have sent them you{\r}
