Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.13,0:50:32.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 这里就是了 老兄 星球日报到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay this is it mac the Daily Planet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.30,0:50:35.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新鲜的水果 小姐 要不要蕃茄啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fresh fruit Hey how about a tomato lady{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.28,0:50:37.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新鲜水果 宝贝 怎么样啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fresh fruitHey baby how's it going{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.70,0:50:39.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新鲜的水果和蔬菜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey fresh fruit and vegetables{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.39,0:50:45.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁新鲜快来买\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fresh fruit and vegetablesGet them while they're hot{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.26,0:50:47.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看这些蕃茄 很美吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at these tomatoes Aren't they beautiful?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.80,0:51:03.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他干的不错 你今天早上有看他的文章吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He did a great job You see his article this morning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.27,0:51:13.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笑一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smile{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.68,0:51:17.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,流血这个词有几个T\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many T's in bloodletting{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.54,0:51:18.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.99,0:51:26.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在写什么 雷恩小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you writing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.42,0:51:28.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,写一首春天的颂诗 杀戮怎么写\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An ode to spring How do you spell massacre{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.72,0:51:34.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,M-A-S-S-A-C-R-E…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}M-A-S-S-A-C-R-E...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.86,0:51:35.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.13,0:51:38.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 雷恩小姐 你怎能写出这么伟大的故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Golly how come you get all the great stories{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.73,0:51:40.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好记者 写不出伟大的故事 吉米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A good reporter doesn't get great stories{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.97,0:51:42.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好记者写得出使他们伟大的故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A good reporter makes them great{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.50,0:51:44.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老编 这是个有关东方谋杀案的故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chief here's that story on the murder case{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.67,0:51:48.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在第一页有大的标题 也许我的照片摆在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The way I see it it's a headline on the front page with my picture{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.07,0:51:50.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,强奸者的奸打错了 露意丝雷恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's only one P in rapist{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.16,0:51:51.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对克拉克肯特说声你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lois Lane say hello to Clark Kent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.05,0:51:53.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉过你打错了 哈啰 雷恩小姐 你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello Miss Lane how are{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.63,0:51:55.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得我的性与药的报导\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember my expose on the sex and drug orgies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.89,0:51:57.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在公立养老院那一篇吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the senior citizens home{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.95,0:52:00.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好啊 吉米欧森 摄影师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are you doing Jimmy Olsen photographer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.19,0:52:02.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨 克拉克肯特 很高兴认识你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi Clark Kent Nice to meet you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.10,0:52:05.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每件事都扯到了 有性 有暴力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's got everything: Sex{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.05,0:52:06.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以伦理的角度 我是指\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}violence the ethnic angle{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.46,0:52:08.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个女摔角手有外国口音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So does a lady wrestler with a foreign accent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.96,0:52:11.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯特 你打开一下吧 好的 白先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kent can you open this Sure Mr White{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.20,0:52:13.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这也许是一个连载题材的好基础\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This could be the basis for a series of articles:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.53,0:52:16.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让无理性的杀戮成为理性 由露意丝雷恩撰写\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Making Sense of Senseless Killings by Lois Lane{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.60,0:52:19.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是指我们有心理学家 有社会学家 我可以约见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We get psychologists sociologists interviews{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.31,0:52:22.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露意丝 你只不过在写一些垃圾而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lois you're pushing a bunch of rinkydink tabloid garbage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.08,0:52:25.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,星球日报有一个传统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Daily Planet has a tradition{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.18,0:52:26.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh I'm sorry I'm sorry{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.08,0:52:29.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 天呀 对不起 我不知道会喷成这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry I didn't mean to shake it up like that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.15,0:52:31.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然不 露意丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course not Lois{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.05,0:52:35.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么有人会想让一个陌生人 看起来像个呆子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would any one want to make a total stranger look like a fool{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.42,0:52:38.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来拿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.56,0:52:40.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 对不起 白先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks I'm sorry Mr White{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.49,0:52:44.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欧森 我是叫你来闲逛的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do I pay you $40 a week when I should have you arrested for loitering{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.16,0:52:45.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去帮先生拿条毛巾来 肯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go get Mr a towel Kent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.77,0:52:47.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快 小子 快 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move kid move Right Chief{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.33,0:52:49.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要黑的 不要糖 好 老编\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make mine black no sugar Right Chief{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.47,0:52:50.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要糖的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And don't call me sugar{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.90,0:52:51.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当番红花开时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while the crocuses bloom{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.13,0:52:54.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 老糖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right Sugar{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.21,0:52:56.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老大要咖啡 不加糖 我去拿柠檬茶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chief wants coffee no sugar I'll take tea with lemon{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.04,0:53:01.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露意丝 你何不带肯特先去见见其他人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lois why don't you take Kent out to meet everybody huh{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.45,0:53:04.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮他介绍一下 这是他第一天来上班\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just introduce him around He's starting on the paper today{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.55,0:53:06.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会让他去城中采访一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm giving him the City beat{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.92,0:53:07.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老编\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chief{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.46,0:53:09.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我的地盘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my beat{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.32,0:53:13.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露意丝 克拉克肯特也许只是一个性情温和的记者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lois Clark Kent may seem like just a mildmannered reporter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.19,0:53:18.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但不只是懂得尊重老编\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but not only does he know how to treat his Chief with the proper respect{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.33,0:53:21.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不只是因为他精力充沛 而且平凡的格调\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not only does he have a snappy punchy prose style{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.13,0:53:22.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是我从事这行四十年来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but he is in my 40 years{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.63,0:53:25.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打字最快的打字员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in this business the fastest typist I have ever seen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.21,0:53:26.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 对不起 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's great{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.66,0:53:28.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你忘了我的文章\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you forgot my article{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.38,0:53:34.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 白先生 我在想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me Mr White I was wondering{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.75,0:53:37.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是否可以 每星期将我薪水的一半\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you could arrange for half my salary{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.35,0:53:39.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,寄到这个地方去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to be sent to this address on a weekly basis{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.22,0:53:41.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的老家吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your bookie right{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.15,0:53:41.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My what{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.02,0:53:43.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't tell me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.09,0:53:46.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是送支票给他 那位甜美灰发的妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He sends a check every week to his sweet grayhaired mother{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.16,0:53:47.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实上是银发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually she's silverhaired{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.86,0:53:51.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 我会办的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see what I can do{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.06,0:53:54.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 白先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you very much Mr White{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.78,0:53:56.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.57,0:53:59.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.27,0:54:02.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像在家吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any more at home like you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.51,0:54:04.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不像 一点也不像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not really no{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.78,0:54:09.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't think so{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.68,0:54:12.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的桌子在这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well get yourself a desk over here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.75,0:54:14.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.82,0:54:17.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 这儿有一些纸张和档案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here there's some paper and a file right there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.76,0:54:18.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.64,0:54:38.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨 我是比尔布利森 嗨 我是克拉克肯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi Bill Breesen Hi Clark Kent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.48,0:54:40.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你 欢迎加入我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice to meet you Welcome aboard{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.65,0:54:44.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你的毛巾 克拉克先生 是肯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's your towel Mr Clark Kent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.88,0:54:45.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么？  - 是肯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What?  - Kent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.99,0:54:48.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克拉克肯特 你是吉米欧森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark Kent Jimmy Olsen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.21,0:54:54.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 那很棒 那你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah lt's fantastic So you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.20,0:54:57.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 我曾见过这家伙 太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I met this really great guy you know Hey fabulous{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.90,0:54:59.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 很棒 我在那个牧场遇到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had this fabulous weekend I met him at this dude ranch{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.72,0:55:01.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有说过我以前 有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l used to ride Yeah{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.73,0:55:03.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我11岁以后就没骑过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't been since I was seven{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.44,0:55:06.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要去寄这些信了 好 再见 祝你今晚好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got to mail these letters Good luck tonight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.37,0:55:07.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嗨 克拉克  - 嗨 露意丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi Clark  - Hi Lois{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.94,0:55:10.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你上班的第一天觉得如何啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you like your first day on the job{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.08,0:55:13.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上班的时数 比我想像的要长一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The hours were sort of longer than I expected{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.71,0:55:16.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但就整体而言 能和你 吉米欧森和白先生见面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but on the whole meeting you and Jimmy Olsen and Mr White{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.05,0:55:19.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要说很突出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gosh on a whole I'd say it's been swell{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.29,0:55:20.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很突出 是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Swell Yup{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.59,0:55:23.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道吗 克拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know Clark{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.12,0:55:27.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球上很少人会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there are very few people left in the world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.63,0:55:29.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,习惯说这个词\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who feel comfortable saying that word{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.80,0:55:31.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么词 突出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What word Swell{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.13,0:55:33.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗 我一直认为这样说很自然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really I always thought it was kind of natural{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.90,0:55:37.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 克拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry Clark{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.96,0:55:39.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt's all right{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.34,0:55:42.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对不起 露意丝  - 哦 嗨雷斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sorry Lois  - Hi Rex{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.23,0:55:43.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 露意丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh Lois{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.28,0:55:45.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你今天好吗  - 直到看到你为止才好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you see anything good today  - Not until you came along{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.26,0:55:46.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 露意丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh Lois{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.41,0:55:47.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 雷斯 这位是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rex this is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.58,0:55:49.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克拉克肯特 你好 拜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark Kent How do See you around{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.82,0:55:52.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露意丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lois{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.72,0:55:55.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 你去哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey where you going{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.12,0:55:56.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮你拿大衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I help you with your coat{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.59,0:55:58.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 好 谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks Can you get that Sure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.46,0:55:59.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你喜欢白先生吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you like Mr White{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.93,0:56:02.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认为他是个好人 吉米欧森也很不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was a nice guy and Jimmy was fantastic{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.76,0:56:04.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 来这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here Come on{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.90,0:56:06.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来 来啊 进来 快 来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in here hurry up Come on{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.57,0:56:08.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克拉克 我们最好快离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'd better get out of here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.13,0:56:09.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想最好是照他的话做 露意丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'd better do what he says Lois{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.07,0:56:11.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来 快进去 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on get in here quick{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.67,0:56:14.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不要 就这样 我们来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't don't do anything It's all right I'm coming{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.37,0:56:15.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're coming{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.38,0:56:16.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.66,0:56:17.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续 退到那里去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on back there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.53,0:56:18.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here Yeah yeah{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.65,0:56:21.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托 别指着我 你会伤到人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't point that at me sir You could hurt somebody with that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.56,0:56:22.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah yeah{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.98,0:56:24.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好了 好了  - 站住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay okay  - Hold it there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.82,0:56:25.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a minute{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.09,0:56:27.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当然明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I realize that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.86,0:56:30.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时候日子很难过 尤其是这几天 但是这不是答案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}times are tough for some these days but this isn't the answer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.79,0:56:34.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能用枪解决社会问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't solve society's problems with a gun{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.26,0:56:36.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道吗 兄弟 你说对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know buddy you're right{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.20,0:56:40.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我要开创新的一页  - 很好 先生 不错的想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm going to turn over a new leaf  - Good for you sir That's the spirit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.90,0:56:42.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看吧 他并不是有意要伤害别人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He doesn't really want to hurt anyone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.80,0:56:45.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等我拿了她的皮包之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right after I rip off this lady's purse{\r}
