Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.21,1:12:59.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.08,1:13:01.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.75,1:13:06.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.82,1:13:08.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A friend{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.13,1:13:15.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Bye{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.67,1:14:30.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好啊 这儿的电梯出问题了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something wrong with the elevator{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.94,1:14:38.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,往下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Going down{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.66,1:14:52.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Officer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.99,1:14:58.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚上好 慕尼警官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good evening Officer Mooney{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.06,1:15:01.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们说忏悔对灵魂有益\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say confession is good for the soul{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.07,1:15:06.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会听听这个人忏悔的 带他走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd listen to this man Take him away{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.05,1:15:53.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快 我们离开这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on let's get out of here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.33,1:16:05.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动作快点 快呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move your ass Come on{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.60,1:16:08.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay let's go Let's go{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.93,1:16:11.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放下你们的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop your weapons Drop your weapons{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.97,1:16:14.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滚你的 快 我们快离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bullshit Come on let's get out of here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.81,1:16:16.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站在那别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay hold it Hold it right there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.04,1:16:18.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 停住你们两个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay freeze you turkeys{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.48,1:16:20.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别开枪 别激动 你抓着我们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't shoot Keep your cool You got us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.37,1:16:46.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bad vibrations{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.17,1:16:50.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官 你不会相信 我发誓 他真的会飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sergeant you don't believe me I swear it flying{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.74,1:16:53.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穿红披风 蓝色衣服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With a big red cape and bright red boots as well{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.75,1:16:55.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,转眼间就来到我面前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quick as a wink he was gone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.40,1:16:58.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后又瞬间离去 就像一只大鸟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He flew up in the air again he did like a big blue bird{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.38,1:17:00.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大鸟 你不相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A big blue bird You don't believe me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.35,1:17:01.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穿着明亮的红披风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With bright red boots{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.99,1:17:03.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,划破漆黑的夜空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take the night off{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.26,1:17:05.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回你的莫菲酒吧继续你的胡编乱造去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go back to Murphy's bar and continue what you started{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.16,1:17:09.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我过几分钟就会去找你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be off in a few minutes and I'll meet you there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.27,1:17:23.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慕尼 第一瓶酒我请 我去拿帽子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The first bottle's on me Let me get my hat{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.79,1:17:36.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布斯基 快从那里下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frisky will you come down from there{\r}
