Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.93,1:17:46.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 没关系的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on it's all right{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.13,1:17:51.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了 小姐 谢谢 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you go miss Gee thanks mister{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.61,1:17:55.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不客气 再见 布斯基\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye Frisky So long now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.28,1:18:00.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Bye{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.62,1:18:06.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈 妈妈 刚才布斯基爬到树上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mommy Mommy Frisky was stuck in the tree{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.45,1:18:09.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有个人从天上飞下来把它给了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then this man swooped out of the sky and gave him to me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.52,1:18:12.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我告诉过你少给我撒谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Haven't I told you to stop telling lies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.36,1:18:19.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首都机场 这里是空军一号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Metropolis Airport this is Air Force One{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.72,1:18:21.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请通报最新的天气情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could we have the latest weather report{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.53,1:18:25.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为暴风雨可见度较低 可视范围500尺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Metropolis currently ceiling 500 overcast 700 broken{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.64,1:18:29.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,风力24025 高度9098\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}visibility one half in showers Wind 24025 Altimeter 9098{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.94,1:18:30.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.21,1:18:34.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来不太好 你认为呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't look good, What do you think{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.81,1:18:39.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 该死的怎么了  - 一号马达失去动力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What the hell was that  - You've lost power in number one{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.28,1:18:41.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,失去动力 那整个动力系统就完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lost power We've lost the whole engine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.82,1:18:43.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电力不足 关闭一号马达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pressure's going Shut down number one{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.99,1:18:45.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加强二号和三号动力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring up two and three{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.16,1:18:47.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们缺少继续运作的动力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We haven't got enough pressure to keep going{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.03,1:18:52.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紧急求救 紧急求救 首都机场 这里是空军一号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mayday mayday Metropolis tower Air Force One{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.66,1:18:55.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们出现了马达故障 现在正在失速中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have lost port outboard engine and part of wing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.90,1:18:58.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要紧急迫降 什么方位？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Request emergency landing, What's the position?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.87,1:19:01.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机场西南方10里处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten miles southwest of Metropolis Airport{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.11,1:19:02.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通知他们总统在飞机上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Notify them the President's on board{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.71,1:19:06.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机场西南方10里处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Present position 10 miles that's 10 miles southwest of Metropolis Airport{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.64,1:19:10.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,方向是306度 高度6000尺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heading: 305 height: 6000 feet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.70,1:19:32.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又怎么了？ 引擎又好了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell happened? We got our engine back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.50,1:19:34.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外面到底怎么回事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell's going on out there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.64,1:19:37.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,驾驶 别乱看 继续驾驶就行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fly don't look just fly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.11,1:19:39.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得到一种力量的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got something{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.38,1:19:43.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别问我是什么 只管相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not saying what it is just trust me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.23,1:19:58.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你乐在其中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You enjoyed it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.83,1:20:03.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道你说什么 父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what to say Father{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.00,1:20:05.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉我分心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am afraid just got carried away{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.91,1:20:09.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你会这样 吾儿 怎么可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I anticipated this my son You couldn't have{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.84,1:20:12.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你无法想像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You couldn't have imagined{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.91,1:20:15.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那感觉有多好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How good it felt{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.98,1:20:19.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全世界都知道你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are revealed to the world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.82,1:20:22.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very well{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.62,1:20:24.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这样吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So be it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.79,1:20:28.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你还是要保持身分的秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you still must keep your secret identity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.13,1:20:30.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.80,1:20:32.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原因有二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The reasons are two{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.00,1:20:35.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一 你没办法28小时拯救人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First: You cannot serve humanity 28 hours a day{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.50,1:20:39.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 二十四  - 喔 二十四\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Twenty-fourth  - Wow twenty-fourth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.06,1:20:41.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是地球的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As it is it won't happen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.64,1:20:46.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会一直求救\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your help will be called for endlessly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.28,1:20:49.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使是那些人类自 就可以解决的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even for those tasks that human beings can solve themselves{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.35,1:20:53.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他们喜于滥用资源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're happy to abuse the resources of the world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.32,1:20:55.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And secondly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.45,1:20:56.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Secondly:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.86,1:20:58.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的敌人将会发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your enemies will discover{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.62,1:21:01.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唯一能伤害你的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}their only way to hurt you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.86,1:21:03.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是伤害你在乎的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by hurting the people you care for{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.40,1:21:06.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you Father{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.83,1:21:07.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lastly:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.54,1:21:13.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要因为感到自负而自责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not punish yourself with your feelings of vanity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.81,1:21:15.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要学着控制它就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simply learn to control them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.91,1:21:18.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是个普世皆同的烦恼 即使在克普顿星球也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is an affliction common to all even on Krypton{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.78,1:21:23.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的毁灭本可避免 如果不是一些自负者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our destruction could have been avoided but for the vanity of some{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.18,1:21:25.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以为我们是不可毁灭的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who considered us indestructible{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.65,1:21:28.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不是为此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were it not for vanity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.79,1:21:31.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,此时此刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at this very moment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.86,1:21:38.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可便可以将你拥入怀中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could embrace you in my arms{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.77,1:21:43.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吾儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my son{\r}
