Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.09,1:28:04.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,六尺四寸 你多重？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}6' 4 And how much do you weigh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.36,1:28:06.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,225磅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Around 225{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.99,1:28:08.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,225磅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}225{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.93,1:28:17.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I assume then that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.10,1:28:22.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你身体其他的功能都正常吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the rest of your bodily functions are normal{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.91,1:28:25.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 再说一遍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I beg your pardon{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.24,1:28:28.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样说好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well putting it delicately{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.58,1:28:33.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你吃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}do you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.85,1:28:37.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,东西吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...eat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.66,1:28:41.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 我饿的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes I do when I'm hungry{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.26,1:28:44.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然 你会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do Of course you do{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.53,1:28:47.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能看穿一切东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well then is it true...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.77,1:28:52.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that you can see through anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.20,1:28:54.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 可以看很多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes I can pretty much{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.91,1:28:59.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对于痛完全没有感觉吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that you're totally impervious to pain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.64,1:29:00.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well so far{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.45,1:29:04.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我穿着什么样的内衣？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What color underwear am I wearing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.89,1:29:10.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 我让你不好意思 不是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I embarrass you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.36,1:29:11.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哦 不  - 我有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No  - I did{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.12,1:29:14.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这道墙是铅盖的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No it's just that this planter must be made of lead{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.93,1:29:16.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 的确 所以呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes it is So{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.86,1:29:20.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道 我我无法透视铅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sort of have a problem seeing through lead{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.53,1:29:22.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真好玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's interesting{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.63,1:29:24.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无法透视铅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Problems with lead{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.34,1:29:27.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的名字叫什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have a first name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.03,1:29:29.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的意思是说 叫罗夫或什么的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like Ralph or something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.51,1:29:30.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不 我的意思是说  - 粉红色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No I mean like  - Pink{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.48,1:29:33.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,粉红色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pink{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.31,1:29:38.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 我不是故意要让你不好意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry I didn't mean to embarrass you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.85,1:29:41.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你并没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't embarrass me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.49,1:29:45.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的背景呢？ 你是那里人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your background? Where are you from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.29,1:29:49.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实上有点难说明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's kind of hard to explain actually{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.59,1:29:52.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从很远很远的地方来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see I'm from Well from pretty far away{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.23,1:29:54.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实上 来自另一个银河系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another galaxy as a matter of fact{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.99,1:29:56.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来自一个叫克普顿星球的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I come from a planet called Krypton{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.20,1:29:59.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克普顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Krypton{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.54,1:30:03.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 克普顿是要怎么写？C-R-I…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cripton With a C-R-I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.21,1:30:08.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 事实上克普顿 是巧克力的克 普通的普\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No actually it's Krypton with a KRYPTON{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.28,1:30:13.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克普 你喜欢粉红色吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you like pink{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.96,1:30:20.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我非常喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like pink very much{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.33,1:30:26.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.90,1:30:27.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.33,1:30:31.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是指你为何在此？ 一定有什么理由让你来此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean why are you here? There must be a reason for you to be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.27,1:30:35.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 我是来此为真理及正义 并以美国的方式而战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes I'm here to fight for truth and justice and the American way{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.07,1:30:39.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你大可在美国竞选公职\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll end up fighting every official in this country{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.21,1:30:41.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是说真的吧 露意丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't really mean that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.58,1:30:44.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不相信  - 露意丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't believe this  - Lois{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.38,1:30:46.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不说谎的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never lie{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.39,1:30:57.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能飞多快？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How fast do you fly by the way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.96,1:31:01.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的不知道 我没有实际的去计算时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know I've never actually bothered to time myself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.63,1:31:03.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道 我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.94,1:31:06.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来了解看看？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't we find out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.00,1:31:08.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你提议我们怎么做？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And how do you propose we do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.57,1:31:12.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我飞一下 你是说我也可以飞？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a ride with me, You mean I could fly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.81,1:31:15.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果可以的话 我可以托着你一起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd be handling the flying if that's okay{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.28,1:31:18.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那就真是太棒了  - 等等你要去哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is utterly fantastic  - Wait a minute, Where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.92,1:31:20.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你是说正经的吗？  - 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you serious?  - Sure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.52,1:31:22.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了？ 你不想去吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you want to go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.49,1:31:25.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 你不需要这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't need these{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.79,1:31:28.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要一件毛衣 一定会冷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need a sweater It must be kind of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.09,1:31:29.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 你不会冷的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No you'll be warm enough{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.10,1:31:36.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.30,1:31:41.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克拉克说你只是人家想像的神话而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark said that you were just a figment of somebody's imagination{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.07,1:31:44.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像小飞侠彼得潘一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like Peter Pan{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.74,1:31:47.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克拉克是谁？ 你的男朋友吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark who's that? Your boyfriend?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.51,1:31:50.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 克拉克 哦 没什么  - 彼得潘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Clark No he's nothing  - Peter Pan{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.38,1:31:56.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彼得潘在童话里 和小孩子们一起飞翔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter Pan flew with children Lois In a fairy tale{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.85,1:35:15.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看得透我的心吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you read my mind{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.96,1:35:23.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道你对我做的代表什么吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know what it is that you do to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.56,1:35:28.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道你是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know who you are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.00,1:35:36.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是一个从别的星球来的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a friend from another star{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.64,1:35:42.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就像是个去学校上课的小孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here I am like a kid out of school{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.78,1:35:46.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓着上帝的手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holding hands with a god{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.45,1:35:49.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是个呆子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a fool{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.56,1:35:52.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看看我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you look at me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.46,1:35:54.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在颤抖着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quivering{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.49,1:35:57.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像个颤抖的小女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like a little girl shivering{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.73,1:36:00.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以感觉得出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can see right through me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.97,1:36:07.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看得透我的心吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you read my mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.34,1:36:13.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以猜测我心里在想什么吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you picture the things I'm thinking of?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.45,1:36:20.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在想为什么你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wondering why you are{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.15,1:36:24.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是太奇妙了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all the wonderful things you are{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.69,1:36:28.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can fly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.49,1:36:32.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞上天际\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You belong in the sky{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.33,1:36:35.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and I{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.30,1:36:38.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也能心系彼此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}could belong to each other{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.51,1:36:43.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你需要个朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you need a friend{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.55,1:36:49.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是你可以飞来的目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the one to fly to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.02,1:36:55.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你需要爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you need to be loved{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.79,1:36:58.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}here I am{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.66,1:37:01.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,读我的心声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Read my mind{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.25,1:37:25.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们忘了计算时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We forgot to time ourselves{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.39,1:37:29.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许下一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe next time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.16,1:37:39.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.20,1:37:45.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.54,1:37:47.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.21,1:37:54.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是个超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a super man{\r}
