Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.51,1:44:38.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes sir{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.15,1:44:42.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不要我的人 做那种我自己也不想做的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't have my men do anything I wouldn't be prepared to do myself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.90,1:44:43.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 但是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah but sir{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.72,1:44:44.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫救护车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get an ambulance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.19,1:44:46.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 大家集合起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gather around{\r}
