Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.39,1:45:18.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.12,1:45:20.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人受伤吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody hurt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.51,1:45:39.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我做到了 路德先生 黛丝玛克小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did it Mr Luthor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.88,1:45:41.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我成功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Teschmacher I did it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.21,1:45:45.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正如你吩咐的 很好 欧提斯 很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like you told me All right Otis{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.12,1:45:47.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 欧提斯 不是我不信任你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It isn't that I don't trust you but{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.45,1:45:50.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我不信任你 你做了什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't trust you Otis What did you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.82,1:45:55.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把第一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I set the first directional vector{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.93,1:45:57.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无线电接到38\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to 38{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.66,1:46:01.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二个到67 第三个到117\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The second one to 67 And the third one to 117{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.83,1:46:03.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第四个呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the fourth one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.77,1:46:04.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第四个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What fourth one{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.20,1:46:08.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 第三到117\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute The third one to 117{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.74,1:46:11.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 我写下来了 路德先生 我写下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes See I wrote it down, Mr Luthor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.12,1:46:12.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欧提斯 欧提斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Otis,Otis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.51,1:46:16.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第三个应该是11 第四个是7\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The third one was supposed to be 11 and the fourth one 7{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.65,1:46:20.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 路德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh gee Mr Luthor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.15,1:46:23.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想我的手臂不够长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess my arm wasn't long enough see{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.92,1:46:26.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想看看长手臂吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like to see a long arm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.39,1:46:29.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欧提斯 你想看看长长的手臂吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Otis would you like to see a very very long arm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.10,1:46:29.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欧提斯 欧提斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh no Mr Luthor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.93,1:46:31.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不路德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No Mr Luthor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.26,1:46:48.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好 这次要做对  - 是的 路德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right Get it right  - Yes Mr Luthor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.28,1:46:54.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麦当劳 我以为你告诉我 这条路已经封锁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}MacDonald I thought you told me this road would be blocked off{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.28,1:46:55.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰柏斯基 我不是告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jablowsky didn't I tell you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.69,1:46:57.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麦当劳 我不是问他 我是问你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't asked him I asked you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.86,1:47:00.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 跟我来 老兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right Follow me men{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.29,1:47:04.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退 把车往后退 把车往后退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back that thing off the road Back it off the road{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.17,1:47:11.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要不要回头 退到路边去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You fellas get back into that thing and back it off the road{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.17,1:47:13.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下会有护卫队过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got a convoy coming through here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.47,1:47:18.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 你们要绕个圆圈回来 我没时间跟你辩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll have to circle back I don't have time to argue{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.48,1:47:20.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是倒霉的日子 不是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a heck of a day isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.95,1:47:27.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们转错弯了 我们在找12号道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We took the wrong turn We were looking for Route 12{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.78,1:47:30.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 12号道 这是后面 不是吗？  - 不 长官 是上面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Route 12 That's back there  - No sir it's up there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.52,1:47:34.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中士 我们转错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sergeant we took the wrong road{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.97,1:47:36.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是少尉 你是在跟长官讲话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a Lieutenant A Naval Officer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:44.67,1:47:47.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 住口  - 从12号道转回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shut up  - Now Route 12 is back that way{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.46,1:47:56.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美国 海军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This man is a diabetic you see{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.06,1:48:11.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我的报社对此事非常的有兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you know the Daily Planet is very interested in that dam{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.40,1:48:13.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我不懂的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but what I don't understand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.40,1:48:16.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为何要卖给一个未曾谋面的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is why you'd sell out to a faceless person you've never met{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:16.53,1:48:19.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你连他的名字都不知道 啊 是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know his name{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.74,1:48:24.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他肯付那么高的价钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At the stupid high price he offered{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:24.14,1:48:26.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,买这片没有价值的沙漠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for this worthless piece of desert{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.64,1:48:28.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望那是值得的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope it's Custer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:30.65,1:48:32.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了 这就是我要的 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect just what I need Thank you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.62,1:48:36.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从弹着点为你报导\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reporting live from the launch site ground zero{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.32,1:48:41.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天真是历史性的一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today marks a historic occasion since{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:41.73,1:48:45.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为两枚XK101火箭 就要同时发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}two XK101 rockets will be launched simultaneously{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.90,1:48:49.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一枚是陆军 一枚是海军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One by the Army and one by the Navy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.73,1:48:52.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨 各位 今天有没有看到露意丝？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi,everybody,Has anybody seen Lois today?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.17,1:48:54.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我没有 但老编想见你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No but the Chief wants to see you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.47,1:48:56.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你挡到我们了 克拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're blocking the set Clark{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.11,1:48:59.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 吉儿 茱蒂今天好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry Gil How's Judy today Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:59.81,1:49:00.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:00.42,1:49:01.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进来 肯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in Kent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.55,1:49:02.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 白先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me Mr White{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:02.91,1:49:05.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想见我？ 你看到露意丝吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanted to see me sir? Have you seen Lois today?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.78,1:49:09.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她出城到西部 去了解一笔土地诈欺交易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's out West looking into a landfraud deal{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.45,1:49:12.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我派欧森陪她一起去 第一次的任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sent young Olsen with her on his first assignment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.16,1:49:15.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有点不是很明确 有人出了不可思议的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some unidentified clown is buying thousands of acres{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.53,1:49:17.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,价钱去买一片沙漠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of worthless desert at incredible prices{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.89,1:49:19.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天呀 好像没什么道理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That doesn't seem to make sense{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.66,1:49:20.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这世界本来就没啥道理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world doesn't make sense{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.81,1:49:22.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯特 你现在应该晓得了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ought to know that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.60,1:49:24.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去看看从阿迪斯阿贝巴来的文件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at this dispatch from Addis Ababa{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.13,1:49:28.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人闯进博物馆 在寂静的夜晚杀了两个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People break into a museum at night kill two people{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.10,1:49:29.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们拿了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and what do they take{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.44,1:49:32.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一件毫无价值的陨石 你觉得怎样 白先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A worthless piece of meteorite How do you figure that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:33.11,1:49:35.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直不能明白暴力的形式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never been able to understand violence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.38,1:49:37.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你 肯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know that about you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.88,1:49:39.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是我想跟你谈的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why I wanted to talk to you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.88,1:49:43.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已在新闻界待四十年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been in this news game 40 years man and boy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:44.32,1:49:47.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这里 我有胆识 有同情 有耐性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I got where I am with guts compassion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:47.99,1:49:51.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有一些是你没有的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}elbow grease and something you're sadly lacking in son{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.00,1:49:52.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谦卑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Humility{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.13,1:49:55.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不是谦卑 你有太多谦卑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not humility you've got bags of humility{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:56.20,1:49:58.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,侵略性 自信心 这是关键\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aggression confidence that's the ticket{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.66,1:50:00.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿主导权吧 让人们知道你是谁吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take charge Let people know who you are{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.70,1:50:02.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么我不是年轻十岁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why l wasn't a boy 10 years{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.20,1:50:09.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让大家知道我是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let people know who l am{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.48,1:50:11.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是莱克斯路德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Lex Luthor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.62,1:50:15.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少于四只脚的 能听到这个的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only one thing alive with less than four legs can hear this frequency{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.25,1:50:16.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有你 超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:16.65,1:50:19.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大约只需五分钟 一种有毒的瓦斯弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In five minutes a poisoned gas pellet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:19.31,1:50:21.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,包含着丙烷元素的混合物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}containing propane lithium compound{\r}
